{"id":"zavtrashnij","lemma":"завтрашний","pos":"adj","rank":4987,"glosses":["tomorrow's"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"завтрашнее","feminine":"завтрашняя","plural":"завтрашние"},"examples":[{"text":"Сегодня - это завтрашнее вчера.","en":"Today is tomorrow's yesterday.","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Не забудь про наше завтрашнее свидание.","en":"Don't forget our date tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"забыть"},{"g":"about, concerning"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null,{"g":"appointment"}]},{"text":"На завтрашний концерт ещё остались билеты?","en":"Are there any tickets left for tomorrow's concert?","words":[{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"concert"},{"g":"still / more"},{"g":"to remain, to stay","l":"остаться"},{"g":"ticket","l":"билет"}]},{"text":"Сегодняшние друзья — это завтрашние враги.","en":"Today's friends are tomorrow's enemies.","words":[{"g":"today's, of this day","l":"сегодняшний"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"enemy, foe","l":"враг"}]},{"text":"Мы не знаем, что нам принесёт завтрашний день.","en":"We don't know what tomorrow will bring.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"to bring","l":"принести"},null,{"g":"day, daytime"}]}]}